  "details": "I've been trying to get into worlds with my friends, and I can't get the worlds to load at ALL. For instance, I've restarted my game 5 times, and tried to load up the amusement park all 5 of those times, but every time I'm stuck waiting for more than 10 minutes because it won't load. I average about 150-200 ping on my good days. I just want to play with my friends, and it's getting to the point where I can't do anything just because the worlds won't load.\n\nEdit - I can get onto the hub just fine, and some worlds load. It's about 50% of the time that it doesn't work.",
